      "---\n",
      "\n",
      "## Day 6：WHERE / ORDER BY / LIMIT\n",
      "\n",
      "### WHERE：行过滤\n",
      "\n",
      "| 运算符 | 说明 | 示例 |\n",
      "|--------|------|------|\n",
      "| `=` | 等于 | `WHERE name = '键盘'` |\n",
      "| `!=` / `<>` | 不等于 | `WHERE price != 0` |\n",
      "| `>` / `<` / `>=` / `<=` | 比较 | `WHERE price > 100` |\n",
      "| `BETWEEN a AND b` | 范围（含边界） | `WHERE price BETWEEN 50 AND 200` |\n",
      "| `IN (...)` | 在集合中 | `WHERE category IN ('书籍', '食品')` |\n",
      "| `LIKE` | 模糊匹配 | `WHERE name LIKE '%键盘%'` |\n",
      "| `IS NULL` / `IS NOT NULL` | 是否为空 | `WHERE email IS NULL` |\n",
      "\n",
      "**LIKE 通配符**：\n",
      "- `%`：任意字符（含 0 个）\n",
      "- `_`：单个字符\n",
      "\n",
      "### ORDER BY：排序\n",
      "\n",
      "```sql\n",
      "ORDER BY col1 ASC, col2 DESC\n",
      "-- ASC = 升序（默认），DESC = 降序\n",
      "-- 支持多列：先按 col1 排，相同的再按 col2 排\n",
      "```\n",
      "\n",
      "### LIMIT / OFFSET：分页\n",
      "\n",
      "```sql\n",
      "SELECT * FROM products\n",
      "ORDER BY price DESC\n",
      "LIMIT 10 OFFSET 0;   -- 第 1 页（第 1-10 条）\n",
      "\n",
      "SELECT * FROM products\n",
      "ORDER BY price DESC\n",
      "LIMIT 10 OFFSET 10;  -- 第 2 页（第 11-20 条）\n",
      "```"
    ]
  },
  {
    "cell_id": "cell-16",
    "cell_type": "code",
    "source": [
      "# Day 6 练习：WHERE / ORDER BY / LIMIT\n",
