    "source": [
      "### 条件组合技巧\n",
      "\n",
      "当 WHERE 条件比较复杂时，用 `()` 控制优先级：\n",
      "\n",
      "```sql\n",
      "-- 电子产品或家具中，价格在 200-1000 的，且库存大于 20\n",
      "SELECT * FROM shop.products\n",
      "WHERE (category = '电子产品' OR category = '家具')\n",
      "  AND price BETWEEN 200 AND 1000\n",
      "  AND stock > 20;\n",
      "```\n",
      "\n",
      "注意：`AND` 优先级比 `OR` 高，所以不加括号的话 `WHERE category = '电子产品' OR category = '家具' AND price > 200` 会被解析为 `category = '电子产品' OR (category = '家具' AND price > 200)`。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "cell_id": "cell-18",
    "cell_type": "code",
    "source": [
      "# 条件组合练习\n",
      "!docker exec pg-learn psql -U postgres -d learn -c \"\n",
      "SELECT name, category, price, stock FROM shop.products\n",
      "WHERE (category = '电子产品' OR category = '家具')\n",
      "  AND price BETWEEN 200 AND 1000\n",
      "  AND stock > 20\n",
      "ORDER BY price;\n",
      "\""
    ]
  },
  {
