    "source": [
      "---\n",
      "\n",
      "## Day 7：UPDATE / DELETE\n",
      "\n",
      "### UPDATE：更新数据\n",
      "\n",
      "```sql\n",
      "UPDATE table_name\n",
      "SET col1 = new_val1,\n",
      "    col2 = new_val2\n",
      "WHERE condition;\n",
      "```\n",
      "\n",
      "**永远先写 WHERE！永远先写 WHERE！永远先写 WHERE！**\n",
      "\n",
      "如果不写 WHERE，就会更新**全表**的每一行。\n",
      "\n",
      "### DELETE：删除数据\n",
      "\n",
      "```sql\n",
      "DELETE FROM table_name WHERE condition;\n",
      "```\n",
      "\n",
      "同样的警告：**永远先写 WHERE！**\n",
      "\n",
      "### 安全删除的技巧\n",
      "\n",
      "```sql\n",
      "-- 先 SELECT 确认要删哪些行\n",
      "SELECT * FROM table_name WHERE condition;\n",
      "\n",
      "-- 确认无误后，把 SELECT * 换成 DELETE\n",
      "DELETE FROM table_name WHERE condition;\n",
      "```"
    ]
  },
  {
    "cell_id": "cell-20",
    "cell_type": "code",
    "source": [
      "# Day 7 练习：UPDATE 和 DELETE\n",
      "\n",
      "# 更新某个商品的价格\n",
      "!docker exec pg-learn psql -U postgres -d learn -c \"\n",
      "UPDATE shop.products SET price = 39.90\n",
      "WHERE id = 1\n",
      "RETURNING id, name, price;\n",
      "\"\n",
      "\n",
      "print(\"---\")\n",
      "\n",
      "# 批量更新：所有电子产品降价 10%\n",
      "!docker exec pg-learn psql -U postgres -d learn -c \"\n",
      "UPDATE shop.products\n",
      "SET price = ROUND(price * 0.9, 2)\n",
      "WHERE category = '电子产品'\n",
      "RETURNING name, price;\n",
      "\"\n",
      "\n",
      "print(\"---\")\n",
      "\n",
      "# 删除库存为 0 的商品（如果有的话）\n",
      "!docker exec pg-learn psql -U postgres -d learn -c \"\n",
      "DELETE FROM shop.products\n",
      "WHERE stock = 0\n",
      "RETURNING id, name;\n",
      "\"\n",
      "# 如果上面没有返回行，说明所有商品库存都大于 0，这是好事\n",
      "\n",
      "print(\"---\")\n",
      "\n",
      "# 验证结果\n",
      "!docker exec pg-learn psql -U postgres -d learn -c \"\n",
      "SELECT COUNT(*) AS 商品总数, ROUND(AVG(price), 2) AS 平均价格 FROM shop.products;\n",
      "\""
    ]
  },
  {
    "cell_id": "cell-21",
    "cell_type": "markdown",
    "source": [
      "> **小贴士**：`RETURNING` 子句是 PostgreSQL 的特色。执行完 UPDATE/DELETE 后返回受影响的行——这样你既能确认操作正确，又不需要再查一次。\n",
      "\n",
      "### 一个经典的坑：UPDATE 的精准位置\n",
      "\n",
      "你可能会想：\n",
      "\n",
      "```sql\n",
      "-- 找最贵的商品，给它涨价 10% — 但哪里错了？\n",
      "UPDATE shop.products\n",
      "SET price = price * 1.1\n",
      "WHERE price = (SELECT MAX(price) FROM shop.products);\n",
      "```\n",
      "\n",
      "问题：UPDATE 执行后，最大值变了！如果 UPDATE 影响了多行（比如两本书价格相同都是最高的），第二次执行就会多更新。\n",
      "\n",
      "正确做法：用主键 ID 定位。"
    ]
  },
