      "---\n",
      "\n",
      "## 🎯 第1周总结\n",
      "\n",
      "| 概念 | 一句话 |\n",
      "|------|--------|\n",
      "| **关系型数据库** | 用「表」来组织数据，表之间通过外键关联 |\n",
      "| **Schema** | 表的分组命名空间，类似文件夹 |\n",
      "| **数据类型** | 每种列有明确的类型：INTEGER、VARCHAR、DECIMAL、TIMESTAMP、JSONB... |\n",
      "| **约束** | NOT NULL、UNIQUE、PRIMARY KEY、FOREIGN KEY、CHECK、DEFAULT |\n",
      "| **INSERT** | `INSERT INTO t (col) VALUES (val) RETURNING *` |\n",
      "| **SELECT** | `SELECT col FROM t WHERE cond ORDER BY col LIMIT n OFFSET m` |\n",
      "| **UPDATE** | `UPDATE t SET col = val WHERE cond` —— 先写 WHERE！ |\n",
      "| **DELETE** | `DELETE FROM t WHERE cond` —— 先写 WHERE！ |\n",
      "\n",
      "### 核心命令肌肉记忆\n",
      "\n",
      "```sql\n",
      "-- 建表\n",
      "CREATE TABLE t (id SERIAL PRIMARY KEY, name VARCHAR(100) NOT NULL);\n",
      "\n",
      "-- 插入\n",
      "INSERT INTO t (name) VALUES ('hello');\n",
      "\n",
      "-- 查询\n",
      "SELECT * FROM t WHERE name LIKE '%he%' ORDER BY id DESC LIMIT 10;\n",
      "\n",
      "-- 更新\n",
      "UPDATE t SET name = 'world' WHERE id = 1;\n",
      "\n",
      "-- 删除\n",
      "DELETE FROM t WHERE id = 1;\n",
      "```\n",
      "\n",
